ian</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Differences in long-term disease activity and treatment of adult patients with childhood- and adult-onset systemic lupus erythematosus</article-title><source>Arthritis Rheum</source><year>2009</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>13</fpage><lpage>20</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19116979</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b10-cln_67p157"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sibbitt</surname><given-names>WL</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Brandt</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name><name><surname>Maldonado</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name><name><surname>Patel</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Ford</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The incidence and prevalence of neuropsychiatric syndromes in pediatric onset systemic lupus erythematosus</article-title><source>J Rheumatol</source><year>2002</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>1536</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12136916</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b11-cln_67p157"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rood</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>ten Cate</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>van Suijlekom-Smit</surname><given-names>LW</given-names></name><name><surname>den Ouden</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ouwerkerk</surname><given-names>FE</given-names></name><name><surname>Breedveld</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Childhood-onset Systemic Lupus Erythematosus: clinical presentation and prognosis in 31 patients</article-title><source>Scand J Rheumatol</source><year>1999</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>222</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10503558</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b12-cln_67p157"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>von Scheven</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Bakkaloglu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>What's new in paediatric SLE</article-title><source>Best Pract Res Clin Rheumatol</source><year>2009</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>699</fpage><lpage>708</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19853834</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b13-cln_67p157"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tucker</surname><given-names>LB</given-names></name><name><surname>Menon</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaller</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>Isenberg</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Adult- and childhood-onset systemic lupus erythematosus: a comparison of onset, clinical features, serology, and outcome</article-title><source>Br J Rheumatol</source><year>1995</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>866</fpage><lpage>72</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7582729</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b14-cln_67p157"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Appenzeller</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Marini</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Costallat</surname><given-names>LT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Damage did not independently influence mortality in childhood systemic lupus erythematosus</article-title><source>Rheumatol Int</source><year>2005</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>619</fpage><lpage>24</lpage><pub-id